  "precedence_comment": [
    "Which window a route uses (CONTRACTS section 24, semantics change 2026-11-22; catalog 2026-11-22).",
    "A number on the endpoint is the surface's word and wins without asking. An endpoint with no",
    "number (or \"auto\") asks its listing; what the listing publishes is used, even when smaller than",
    "[defaults]. When the listing publishes nothing, a model in the catalog above uses its catalog",
    "window (not for an endpoint on this machine). [defaults] max_context_tokens is only the fallback",
    "for when nothing resolves; with no [defaults] the fallback is 65536. Each case: the endpoint line,",
    "the [defaults] line, what the fake endpoint publishes, and the window + source the route must carry",
    "after settling. A case with `hosted` runs against that chat URL and model with the network stubbed",
    "to publish what `publishes` says (a listing for that model, or nothing)."
  ],
